Emergency room, Emergency room! X-ray, X-ray, X-ray! Injection, Injection, Injection! Operation, Operation, Operation!

38
00:01:57.758 --> 00:02:08.113
Ward, Ward, Ward! Plaster cast, Plaster cast! Crutches, Crutches, Crutches! Wheelchair, Wheelchair, Wheelchair!

39
00:02:08.413 --> 00:02:11.054
Clap, clap! Great chanting!

40
00:02:12.050 --> 00:02:33.164
Dara fell off his bike and hurt his leg. Mum took him to the emergency room. The doctor did an X-ray: his leg was broken! He didn't need an operation, but he got an injection and a plaster cast. He stayed in the ward for one night. Now he walks with crutches. At school, a friend in a wheelchair helps him with the doors.

41
00:02:33.464 --> 00:02:35.939
I love this story, Ms. Lily!

